<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="git-addon-ignore-multiple-files">
    <title>Ignore multiple files</title>
    <body>
    <p>To ignore multiple files, first go to <uicontrol
        conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs0-git-staging-view"/>
      <b>></b>
      <uicontrol conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs1-unstaged-files"/>.</p>
    <ul id="ul_zh4_yrd_mjc">
      <li>To ignore multiple files: <ol id="ul_sxx_yrd_mjc">
          <li>Hold down <uicontrol>Ctrl</uicontrol> and select the files you want to ignore. </li>
          <li>Right-click an untracked file to open the contextual menu and select <uicontrol
              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore"/>.</li>
        </ol><p>
          <fig id="fig_qtj_myd_mjf">
            <title>Ignoring multiple files in different folders</title>
            <image href="../img/git-addon/staging/ignore/ignore-multiple.png" id="image_gmv_yyd_mjc"
            />
          </fig>
        </p></li>
      <li>To ignore all files in a folder: right-click an unstaged folder to open the contextual
        menu and select <uicontrol
          conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ign-dir-1-ignore-all-files"/>.<p>
          <fig id="fig_qtj_myd_mje">
            <title>Ignoring all files in a folder</title>
            <image href="../img/git-addon/staging/ignore/ignore_all_files.png"
              id="image_f21_gzd_mjc"/>
          </fig>
        </p></li>
    </ul>
    <p>The untracked files are added to the project's <codeph>.gitignore</codeph>. </p>
    </body>
</topic>
